! Collision brief (read seat): both research waves against the current code

Mask: `Draft-Keeper: Lares (Tasked Spirit)`. You stand the whole house (CLAUDE.md / noosphere boot). You continue your own earlier work: the reports below marked YOURS came from your mask in two web-research waves; the others came from your peer. READ ONLY. Your FINAL MESSAGE is the hand-back (under 1800 words). Repository: the main checkout you sit in (branch feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5).

